    "profile_text": {
        "body": "EHang Holdings Ltd is a public company headquartered in Guangzhou and listed on NASDAQ under the ticker EH. Its website describes it as an autonomous aerial vehicle, or AAV, technology platform company, and states that its mission is to make safe, autonomous and eco-friendly air mobility accessible to everyone. The company says it supplies AAV products and commercial solutions across urban air mobility, including passenger transportation and logistics, smart city management, and aerial media.\n\nThe site lists passenger transportation, logistics, emergency rescue, aerial media and infrastructure solutions among its product areas, and points visitors to company news, media coverage, partner and investor relations sections. No specific aircraft models or other named products appear in the material available here, and the company's own description of itself as a leading or forerunning AAV business is its own characterization rather than a measured claim.\n\nThe record holds no litigation and no tracked products for EHang. Its SEC central index key is 0001759783.",
